#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.kbreakout.appdata.xml:9
msgid "KBreakOut"
msgstr "KBreakOut"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.kbreakout.appdata.xml:10
msgid "KBreakOut is a Breakout-like game by KDE"
msgstr "KBreakOut je KDE-ova igra nalik na Breakout"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kbreakout.appdata.xml:12
msgid "The objective of KBreakOut is to destroy as many bricks as possible without losing the ball."
msgstr "Cilj igre KBreakOut uništiti je što više cigli, a pritom ne izgubiti lopticu."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kbreakout.appdata.xml:15
msgid "The player is presented with a game field containing a number of bricks. A ball travels across the screen, bouncing off the top and side walls. When a brick is hit, the ball bounces away and the brick is destroyed. The player loses a life when the ball touches the bottom of the field. To prevent this from happening, the player has to use a movable bar to bounce the ball upward, situated at the bottom of the window. The purpose of the game is to progress through the levels destroying all bricks present in each, and trying to get a highscore."
msgstr "Igraču se prikazuje polje s određenim brojem cigli. Loptica se kreće zaslonom odbijajući se od gornjih i bočnih zidova. Kada udari u ciglu, odbije se, a cigla se uništi. Igrač gubi život kada loptica dotakne dno polja. Da bi to spriječio, igrač koristi pomičnu palicu pri dnu prozora kako bi odbio lopticu prema gore. Cilj je prolaziti kroz razine uništavajući sve cigle na svakoj od njih i pokušati ostvariti najbolji rezultat."

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.kbreakout.appdata.xml:25
msgid "Playing KBreakOut"
msgstr "Igranje igre KBreakOut"
